              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Opens from View > All Workspaces, and mid-drag by dwelling on an All workspaces row at the bottom of the rail. The accent bar marks herdr's focused workspace, as in the rail. Click a thumbnail to jump there. Drop a pane on a thumbnail to move it into that tab: the card outlines in accent and the tab takes the drop wash. Dwell 500ms to spring-load into the workspace. Esc returns.",
